{"id": "EUVD-2026-108302", "enisaUuid": "e5495d68-42c2-33b1-9dcf-5759c3bdbb21", "description": "Wasmtime 47.0.0 before 48.0.4 and 49.0.0 before 49.0.2 contains a missing GC rooting vulnerability that leaves references live across try_call unrooted when compiling Wasm modules. Attackers can supply Wasm modules whose callee triggers garbage collection, leaving stale or dangling references that cause GC heap corruption or incorrect execution.", "datePublished": "2026-10-22T19:13:47", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-22T19:13:47", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:L/UI:P/VC:N/VI:N/VA:H/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/security/advisories/GHSA-hw8m-q44c-ggrf", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/wasmtime-47.0.0-before-48.0.4-and-49.0.0-before-49.0.2-gc-heap-corruption-via-try-call"], "aliases": ["GHSA-gjjx-5mxw-qhf8", "CVE-2026-115379"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.0, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "1d9b5823-dcb6-3780-9ba4-f2188ec58653", "product": {"name": "wasmtime", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}, "product_version": "49.0.0 <49.0.2"}, {"id": "e669ed3f-cfb8-3474-a1d9-f148dfefed82", "product": {"name": "wasmtime", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}, "product_version": "47.0.0 <48.0.4"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "5886b9e7-266b-301c-a6ee-46c7ce7f77ce", "vendor": {"name": "bytecodealliance"}}], "isExploited": false}